#   tile index = [$E952 + code]; glyph = 4 tiles at +$00 +$10 +$100 +$110
# Verified against the yaku name table at bank 04 $9E18.
# $00 doubles as the string terminator AND a blank glyph.
# $4F/$66/$67 are blank slots - glyphs were never drawn (see notes).

